<style>
  .reviews-wrapper {
    padding: 4rem 0;
  }
  
  .reviews-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  
  .add-review-btn {
    background: none;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .add-review-btn svg {
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
  }
  
  /* Media Row */
  .reviews-media-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    overflow-x: auto;
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    scrollbar-width: none;
    -ms-overflow-style: none;
  }
  .reviews-media-row::-webkit-scrollbar {
    display: none;
  }

  .review-media-card {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 280px;
    aspect-ratio: 9 / 16;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-foreground);
    border-radius: 8px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: var(--color-white);
    color: var(--color-gray-800);
    font-size: 14px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  
  /* Text Reviews List */
  .reviews-text-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  
  .review-text-card {
    border: 1px solid var(--color-foreground);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    background: var(--color-white);
  }

  .review-stars-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  
  .review-stars {
    color: #FFC107;
    display: flex;
    gap: 2px;
  }
  .review-stars svg {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    fill: currentColor;
  }

  .review-verified {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-foreground);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
  }
  .review-verified svg {
    color: #4CAF50;
  }
  
  .review-body {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-foreground);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  
  .review-meta {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--color-gray-500);
  }
</style>

<div class="reviews-wrapper full-width animate-up page-container">
  <div class="reviews-header">
    <h2 class="section-heading-global" style="margin-bottom:0;">{{ section.settings.title }}</h2>
    <button class="add-review-btn btn-radial-reveal" aria-label="Add a review" style="--hover-bg:#000; --hover-color:#fff; border-radius:50%; padding:8px;">
      <span class="btn-radial-reveal__text"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="16"></line><line x1="8" y1="12" x2="16" y2="12"></line></svg></span>
    </button>
  </div>

  <div class="reviews-media-row">
    <div class="review-media-card">Video</div>
    <div class="review-media-card">Video</div>
    <div class="review-media-card">Images</div>
    <div class="review-media-card">Video</div>
  </div>

  <div class="reviews-text-list">
    
    <div class="review-text-card">
      <div class="review-stars-header">
        <div class="review-stars">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"></polygon></svg>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"></polygon></svg>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"></polygon></svg>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"></polygon></svg>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"></polygon></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="review-verified">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline></svg>
          Verified Purchaser
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="review-body">
        The out put of visiting cards is excellent and is having elegant look. Your delivery time duration is commendable, I mean very quick delivery, and beyond expectations.
      </div>
      <div class="review-meta">
        15 Aug 2026 | Arvind Kumar | 8 days ago.
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="review-text-card">
      <div class="review-stars-header">
        <div class="review-stars">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"></polygon></svg>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"></polygon></svg>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"></polygon></svg>
